\\\\inetput\\\\\\\\wwwroot\\\\\\\\Archer\\\"\"\r\n        },{\r\n          \"Key\":\"CHOOSE_MODULE_HEADER\",\"Value\":\"Add New Report\"\r\n        },{\r\n          \"Key\":\"CHOOSE_MODULE_HELPTEXT\",\"Value\":\"To create a report, select an application from the list below\"\r\n        },{\r\n          \"Key\":\"COMMA_EXAMPLE\",\"Value\":\"Example:  'Metro','1.6','2003','Industrial Park'\"\r\n        },{\r\n          \"Key\":\"COMMA_LABEL\",\"Value\":\"Comma\"\r\n        },{\r\n          \"Key\":\"CROSS_REF_BEHAVIOR_APPEND\",\"Value\":\"Append to Existing Cross-Reference Data\"\r\n        },{\r\n          \"Key\":\"CROSS_REF_BEHAVIOR_APPEND_DESC\",\"Value\":\"Append the references that are contained in the data file to the existing references contained in each record.\"\r\n        },{\r\n          \"Key\":\"CROSS_REF_BEHAVIOR_LABEL\",\"Value\":\"Cross-Reference Behavior\"\r\n        },{\r\n          \"Key\":\"CROSS_REF_BEHAVIOR_REPLACE\",\"Value\":\"Replace Existing Cross-Reference Data\"\r\n        },{\r\n          \"Key\":\"CROSS_REF_BEHAVIOR_REPLACE_DESC\",\"Value\":\"Replace all existing references with only the references contained in the data file.\"\r\n        },{\r\n          \"Key\":\"DATAIMPORTWIZARD_STEP1_ADVANCED_OPTIONS_HEADER\",\"Value\":\"Advanced Options\"\r\n        },{\r\n          \"Key\":\"DATAIMPORTWIZARD_STEP1_ADVANCED_OPTIONS_HELPTEXT\",\"Value\":\"The fields below allow you to specify advanced import options, include determining if your data fields contain field values quotes and if you desire to send a notification for each record created and updated after the import process has completed.  Additionally, if your application contains cross-references, you can determine if reference data is replaced or appended.\"\r\n        },{\r\n          \"Key\":\"DATAIMPORTWIZARD_STEP1_CAPTION\",\"Value\":\"Step 1 - Import File Information\"\r\n        },{\r\n          \"Key\":\"DATAIMPORTWIZARD_STEP1_FORMAT_OPTIONS_HEADER\",\"Value\":\"Format Options\"\r\n        },{\r\n          \"Key\":\"DATAIMPORTWIZARD_STEP1_FORMAT_OPTIONS_HELPTEXT\",\"Value\":\"Choose the options below that best fit your import file. You can specify field delimiters (characters that separate your fields), specify value delimiters (characters that separate multiple values in a single field) and indicate whether HTML formatting is present within \"\r\n        },{\r\n          \"Key\":\"DATAIMPORTWIZARD_STEP1_HELPTEXT\",\"Value\":\"Click \\\"Browse\\\" and select the delimited file that contains the external information you want to import into the Archer GRC Platform. Only data contained in delimited files can be imported. A delimited file is a file in which fields are separated by a specific character, such as a comma or tab. Common file extensions for delimited files include .TXT and .CSV.\"\r\n        },{\r\n          \"Key\":\"DATAIMPORTWIZARD_STEP2_CAPTION\",\"Value\":\"Step 2 - Identification\"\r\n        },{\r\n          \"Key\":\"DATAIMPORTWIZARD_STEP2_HELPTEXT\",\"Value\":\"The Data Import Manager can perform the following import types: \\\"Create New Records\\\" or \\\"Update Existing Records\\\". If you select the \\\"Update Existing Records\\\" option, you must specify one or more fields from the Archer application, questionnaire or sub-form that should be used as a unique identifier for the data import. When a match cannot be found between the source file and an existing Archer record, the system creates a new record when you select the \\\"Update Existing Records\\\" option.\"\r\n        },{\r\n          \"Key\":\"DATA_ROW_LABEL\",\"Value\":\"Data Row\"\r\n        },{\r\n          \"Key\":\"DEFAULT\",\"Value\":\"Default\"\r\n        },{\r\n          \"Key\":\"ESCAPE_OTHER_DESCRIPTION\",\"Value\":\"Example: \\\"c:**\\\\Inetput**\\\\wwwroot**\\\\Archer\\\"\"\r\n        },{\r\n          \"Key\":\"ESCAPE_SEQUENCE_LABEL\",\"Value\":\"Escape Sequence\"\r\n        },{\r\n          \"Key\":\"FIELDTYPE_COLUMN_LABEL\",\"Value\":\"Field Type\"